cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use OpenBuddy in academic work, please cite it as below.
title: "OpenBuddy: An Open Desktop AI Workspace"
abstract: >-
  OpenBuddy is an MIT-licensed desktop AI workspace built on Electron
  and the Pi coding agent. It features a 30+ package Cordis capability
  mesh, enterprise-grade Casdoor × NewAPI integration, multi-agent
  A2A protocol support, and a fully visible test suite.
type: software
license: MIT
license-url: https://github.com/louloulin/OpenBuddy/blob/main/LICENSE
repository-code: https://github.com/louloulin/OpenBuddy
url: https://openbuddy.dev

authors:
